<h2 id="who-its-for">👥 Who GoHighLevel Is For</h2>

**Ideal for:**
- Multi-location operators (3+ locations) seeking tool consolidation
- Franchise systems needing standardized marketing across locations
- Service businesses with appointment-based models (salons, spas, fitness, healthcare)
- Operators with dedicated marketing or operations staff to manage the platform
- Businesses heavily reliant on SMS communication with customers
- Anyone currently paying $500+/month across fragmented marketing tools

**Not ideal for:**
- Single-location businesses without expansion plans (overkill and over-complex)
- E-commerce businesses needing deep inventory and fulfillment integration
- Operators without 40+ hours available for implementation
- Teams requiring enterprise-grade reporting and analytics
- Businesses needing sophisticated email marketing as their primary channel

